&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a driven, resilient and results-oriented Account Executive to strengthen our expert Sales Team in San Francisco. This is a high-energy, sales role: you&#39;ll bring new tour, activity and attraction operators onto GetYourGuide&#39;s platform, and act as the local expert on how that market is responding to our growth initiatives. You will focus on building and managing a high-performing sales pipeline, negotiating optimal terms, and driving supplier acquisition across the US &amp;amp; Canada, directly impacting millions of travellers while advancing GetYourGuide&#39;s position in the experience industry.&lt;/p&gt;
