&lt;li&gt;Present in-person and online demos of GetYourGuide&#39;s products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Educate operators on trends shaping the industry and give them insight on how to adapt, encouraging them to think differently about their business&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Effectively manage the entire sales funnel, including outreach, negotiation, closing and onboarding, to consistently hit and exceed quota&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with internal teams to align supplier acquisition with broader business goals, ensuring sustainable growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent GetYourGuide at relevant industry events to drive acquisition and build credibility&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Listen closely to what operators want and feed that insight back to senior management&lt;/li&gt;
