&lt;li&gt;You bring strong problem-solving skills, using data to prioritize actions and inform decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent level English, with strong communication, presentation &amp;amp; negotiation skills, able to articulate value clearly across diverse audiences&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledgeable about the travel industry, able to use that expertise to talk credibly with Tour operators &amp;amp; Attractions&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analytical and data-driven, with the ability to assess opportunities, read prospective buyers and use data to prioritise and persuade&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confident using CRM (Salesforce) and sales enablement tools, to Collaborative by nature, sharing best practices with peers and helping lift the wider team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willing to work from the office on Monday, Tuesday, and Thursday&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
