&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years of experience in &lt;strong&gt;strategy&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;customer success&lt;/strong&gt;, or a related field in a fast-paced environment (e.g. marketplace, SaaS scaleup, consulting, or B2B platform); experience in global or multi-market contexts is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of &lt;strong&gt;owning and delivering strategic programmes&lt;/strong&gt; end-to-end - from problem definition through to measurable business impact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong &lt;strong&gt;cross-functional influence skills&lt;/strong&gt;: you can move senior stakeholders in Product, Supply, and commercial teams without direct authority, and build credibility through insight and rigour&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analytically sharp and data-driven&lt;/strong&gt;: you define KPIs, interrogate data, and build a clear narrative from both quantitative and qualitative signals&lt;/li&gt;
