&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team mission&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a driven, analytical, outcome-focused Project Manager to join our Merchandising team. You&#39;ll take open-ended quality challenges on our supplier and traveler-facing data, think activity attributes, categories, and location data, and turn them into scoped, measurable projects, using AI to scale your work across our inventory. This is a data and process role: you&#39;ll be working with structured content and quality metrics, not copywriting or editorial content.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your mission&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own outcome-driven projects end-to-end: set the scope, timeline, and success metric upfront, then run execution independently (i.e., freelancer content batches, supplier data fixes, or full quality evaluation cycles)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define what &quot;good&quot; means for your domain: build and validate datasets, set precision and recall targets, and keep both current as new failure patterns surface.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build AI-powered quality checks: configure and orchestrate LLM-based workflows that replace manual review at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with senior stakeholders to scope ambiguous problems, then own execution independently: prioritize by data-backed impact over ticket volume, close gaps before they turn into blockers, and present your solutions with clarity and conviction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your toolkit&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience owning projects end to end, from turning a fuzzy operational problem into a bounded project with a clear scope through to a delivered result&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience configuring and orchestrating AI and LLM tools (OpenAI, Anthropic, or similar APIs) to automate quality checks, build datasets or replace manual review (you don&#39;t need have built models from scratch)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable with SQL and notebook-based data tools (Databricks or similar) to query and validate data independently.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You use data to prioritize, define success metrics and validate hypotheses&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You scope work independently with senior stakeholders and resolve alignment issues without being asked.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience running processes where the output must hold up at volume, such as freelancer operations, quality standards or tooling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are a clear communicator, both written and verbal and are fluent in English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Extras that give you an edge&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building or fine-tuning LLM prototypes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A background in content quality, supplier operations, or marketplace quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with precision/recall frameworks and quality evaluation methods.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
