&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communication:&lt;/strong&gt; Excellent written and verbal communication skills in English, able to explain technical concepts clearly to technical and non-technical audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data engineering depth:&lt;/strong&gt; Expertise in &lt;strong&gt;SQL &amp;amp; Python&lt;/strong&gt;, building robust data pipelines and data models, and operating data at scale in warehouses/lakes (e.g., &lt;strong&gt;Delta&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;Snowflake&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;PostgreSQL/MySQL&lt;/strong&gt;) with strong focus on &lt;strong&gt;data quality, accuracy, and reliability&lt;/strong&gt;. Strong &lt;strong&gt;dbt&lt;/strong&gt; proficiency and familiarity with &lt;strong&gt;Spark&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
