&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Business and stakeholder focus:&lt;/strong&gt; Able to prioritize effectively, manage stakeholders, and translate business needs into clear technical plans and delivered outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Autonomy &amp;amp; ownership:&lt;/strong&gt; Proactive, customer-oriented, and comfortable owning projects end-to-end, balancing system health (monitoring, performance, cost) with new delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team impact:&lt;/strong&gt; Collaborative and mentoring-minded, enjoys sharing knowledge, raising standards through reviews, and helping the team succeed.&lt;/li&gt;
