&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team mission&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;GetYourGuide&#39;s Localization team plays a critical role in making travel experiences accessible and compelling for millions of travelers worldwide. We ensure that every piece of content resonates authentically with local markets while maintaining the highest quality standards. Our team combines deep linguistic expertise with cutting-edge technology to scale localization efficiently and effectively across GetYourGuide&#39;s global marketplace.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As our Senior Localization Specialist focused on Language Quality &amp;amp; AI, you will own our strategy for evaluating language quality, as well as testing and training AI models to help us achieve quality at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a project-based role in which you will lead 1-3 major initiatives each quarter. Your work will directly support our global growth, requiring a blend of strategic thinking, creative problem-solving, and data-driven rigor to deliver measurable improvements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your mission&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
