&lt;li&gt;Design scalable quality measurement workflows, including integrations with TranslatedOS and automation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Measure and report on language quality&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;across 36+ languages and multiple content types (product, marketing, inventory), and establish quality benchmarks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze quality data (e.g. error patterns) and deliver insights into how quality levels impact users and business outcomes across different markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with internal and external stakeholders&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;(e.g., Engineering, Quality Account Managers) to align on MT architecture decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
