&lt;li&gt;Customer-centric prioritization and data-driven decision-making&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mature judgment in choosing when and how to use AI tools, proactively lead the team in adopting and evaluating new AI technologies, and support others in applying AI effectively while maintaining strong standards for quality, security, and governance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication skills in English, with the ability to clearly explain technical concepts to others&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
