&lt;p&gt;Ready to unlock your potential with a community of fellow explorers? Find your next role at our Berlin HQ or one of our local offices around the globe, from New York to Bangkok. Head to&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.getyourguide.careers/&quot;&gt;getyourguide.careers&lt;/a&gt; to take the first step.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team mission&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Care at GetYourGuide is in the middle of a fundamental transformation — and it&#39;s one of the most important bets we&#39;re making as a company. We&#39;re moving from traditional human-led support to an LLM-powered model, where AI handles the majority of interactions and our human teams focus on the cases that genuinely need them. That shift changes everything: how we staff, how we plan, how we measure, and what &quot;great care&quot; even looks like.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Care Experience &amp;amp; Strategy team sits at the centre of this change. We&#39;re the function that turns operational complexity into clarity — owning the forecasting, analytics, and strategic planning that keep Care running as the model underneath it evolves. This isn&#39;t a team that maintains what exists. It&#39;s a team that&#39;s actively rebuilding how a world-class support organisation operates in an AI-first world. If you&#39;re energised by building something new rather than running something established, this is where you want to be.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your mission&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Manager of Workforce Management, you&#39;ll own the forecasting and planning capability that Care&#39;s transformation depends on. Reporting to the Head of Care Experience &amp;amp; Strategy, you&#39;ll lead a team of three WFM specialists to replace our manual, Google Sheets-based forecasting models with an AI and automations driven approach — cutting forecast run time from ~23 hours to under 2 hours, while sharpening the accuracy our operations rely on. This is a build role, not a maintain role. You&#39;ll set the direction, make the calls on methodology and tooling, and take your team along with you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead the end-to-end transformation of our forecasting capability, &lt;/strong&gt;replacing manual Google Sheets-based models with an AI-driven solution that improves both speed and accuracy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build and mature forecasting models for emerging lines of business&lt;/strong&gt;, ensuring our planning capability scales alongside GetYourGuide&#39;s growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop a &lt;strong&gt;scenario modelling capability&lt;/strong&gt; that enables Care leadership to stress-test assumptions, model trade-offs, and make faster, more confident operational decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead, coach, and develop a team of three WFM specialists&lt;/strong&gt; — setting clear goals, giving regular feedback, and creating an environment where the team can do their best work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive AI adoption within your team&lt;/strong&gt; — identifying new use cases, building workflows and automations, and helping your team develop their own AI capabilities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner closely&lt;/strong&gt; with Care Operations, Finance, and Technology stakeholders to ensure forecasting outputs are understood, trusted, and acted upon&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Define and own the metrics&lt;/strong&gt; that measure forecast quality, model performance, and planning effectiveness — using data to continuously improve&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strengthen the &lt;strong&gt;continuous feedback loop between Realtime Management insights and future forecasts&lt;/strong&gt;, driving continuous improvement of our forecasting accuracy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your toolkit&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of professional experience, with at least 3 in workforce management, operations analytics, or a related planning function, ideally within a customer care, support, or contact centre environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of building or significantly improving forecasting models, with a strong grasp of forecasting methodologies and their practical trade-offs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience applying automation and AI tools to improve the quality and efficiency of your work — you can share concrete examples of workflows or automations you&#39;ve built and the impact they had&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical skills — comfortable working with large datasets, building models, and translating complex outputs into clear operational recommendations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading a small team of specialists, with the ability to set direction, develop people, and maintain high standards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent stakeholder communication skills — you can translate technical forecasting concepts into language that resonates with operational and senior leadership audiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A bias for action and continuous improvement — you don&#39;t wait to be told something is broken before fixing it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Extras that give you an edge&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with WFM platforms (e.g. Verint, NICE, Assembled, or similar)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with Python, SQL, or other tools used for data modelling and automation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building forecasting models in a multi-channel or multi-LOB care environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to scenario planning or capacity modelling in an operational context&lt;/li&gt;
